        "@tbl-synthetic-assets summarizes the characteristics of the $N = 50$ synthetic assets. The true covariance matrix is constructed as\n",
        "\n",
        "$$\n",
        "\\Sigma = \\sigma_m^2 \\beta\\beta' + \\text{diag}(\\sigma_\\varepsilon^2),\n",
